WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.221
Hello!

2
00:00:04.222 --> 00:00:06.865
Who

3
00:00:06.866 --> 00:00:10.932
are you? I'm

4
00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:14.485
a brown pelican. We

5
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:18.799
are large seabirds. Where

6
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.363
do you live? Brown

7
00:00:21.364 --> 00:00:25.549
pelicans live in North America. We

8
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:29.179
live along the coast. We

9
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.994
like the ocean. Where

10
00:00:32.995 --> 00:00:35.942
do you lay eggs? We

11
00:00:35.943 --> 00:00:39.555
make nests on cliffs. Sometimes

12
00:00:39.556 --> 00:00:44.085
we make nests in trees. Do

13
00:00:44.086 --> 00:00:46.758
you live alone? No.

14
00:00:46.759 --> 00:00:51.032
Brown pelicans live in groups. We

15
00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:55.731
like to fly over the water together.

16
00:00:55.732 --> 00:00:59.368
What do you eat?

17
00:00:59.369 --> 00:01:03.813
We mostly eat fish.

18
00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:08.880
Sometimes we eat shrimp or crabs.

19
00:01:08.881 --> 00:01:12.004
How do you find food?

20
00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:14.763
We hunt from up in the air.

21
00:01:14.764 --> 00:01:17.175
Then we dive down.

22
00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:21.484
And we scoop up fish!

23
00:01:21.485 --> 00:01:24.428
You have a big bill!

24
00:01:24.429 --> 00:01:27.627
Our bills have pouches.

25
00:01:27.628 --> 00:01:31.668
We can catch lots of fish with them.

26
00:01:31.669 --> 00:01:34.539
I'm hungry.

27
00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.868
See you later.

28
00:01:37.869 --> 00:01:43.387
Good-bye, Brown Pelican!

